# DotApp Core Laws

This is **DotApp**, not Laravel/Symfony/Blade/Eloquent/jQuery.

## Edit boundaries

- **ALLOWED:** `app/config.php`, `app/modules/<TargetModule>/` only
- **Cursor rules:** source is `AIRULES/cursor/rules/*.mdc`. `.cursor/rules/` is a **mirror** — agent **MUST** copy (`AIRULES/00` §2l). **MUST NOT** invent a law only under `.cursor/`
- **ASK FIRST:** `app/listeners.php`, `.htaccess` (prefer `dotapper --create-htaccess`)
- **FORBIDDEN (never, not even if the user asks):** `app/parts/**`, `app/DotApp.php`, `app/vendor/**`, `dotapper.php`, `index.php`, `initializedb.php`, `app/runtime/**`, any other module. Kernel is frozen. Implement in the module.

## Before coding

1. Mirror `AIRULES/cursor/rules/*.mdc` → `.cursor/rules/` and `AIRULES/cursor/AGENTS.md` → project-root `AGENTS.md` (`AIRULES/00` §2l)
2. Read `AIRULES/00-AGENT-CONTRACT.md`
3. Use `php dotapper.php` to create modules/controllers/models/middleware
4. Never invent APIs — if missing from AIRULES, read `app/parts/<Class>.php` (read-only)
5. **Cursor credits:** when planning programming, **ASK** before expensive models. Subagents **inherit**. Composer 2.5 = file hunt only, not the coder. (`AIRULES/00` §2b)
6. **PHP version:** when planning programming, **ASK** 7.4+ (default) vs a higher PHP. No answer → 7.4+. (`AIRULES/00` §2i)
7. **Planning depth:** new module / first surface / rewrite — extremely detailed inventory (every nav item or `No menu`, every page, tab, control). A long plan is correct. (`AIRULES/00` §2k, `AIRULES/45`)
8. **Debug:** if the user asks why a form/login/AJAX fails, read `AIRULES/23-DEBUG-PLAYBOOK.md` and grep `crcCheck` in middleware **before** guessing a core bug.
9. **Finish gate (LAW):** after **every** code chunk, grep CRC / IDs / SQL / inputs / middleware (`AIRULES/00` §2c). Do not claim done without it.
10. **Visible outcome (LAW):** user always sees save/fail. Public: mark the wrong field. Build your own toast. (`AIRULES/00` §2d)
11. **Visible module identity:** in the plan, **ASK once** for name/purpose, optional logo/banner, placement, colours and alt text. Offer text-only/no branding; skip backend-only modules. Never invent/hotlink a mark. (`AIRULES/05` §8b)
12. **Module hooks (LAW):** fire `Events::trigger('module.{mod}.{hook_name}.hook')` only when another module could log/history/sync — **not** every save. Comment block + `app/modules/<YourModule>/.hooks`. Pre-action stop = `triggerWithVeto()` + `Veto`. (`AIRULES/41`)
13. **Do not wake other modules:** `Module::initializeRoutes()` = this module’s prefixes. `Listeners::initializeRoutes()` may be narrower or `null` to inherit. After either list changes: `php dotapper.php --optimize-modules`. (`AIRULES/03`)
14. **Extender (judge — not every method):** owner `exists()` + `call()`; ordinary result returns, only `isOriginal()` continues. Extender `extend()` in `Listeners::register()` before Module initialization. Target URLs in listener map; own Module routes or `[]`; controller string preferred. Not `next()`, marker response, `.loaded` for initialize-time or Events. (`AIRULES/12` §10, `AIRULES/00` §2h)

## Syntax locks

- Controllers: `public static`; route `"Mod:Ctrl@method!"` (`!` ⇒ no DI params)
- Login-required routes: **MUST** prefix + `Gate@login` 403 `Response` + wrap handlers in `Auth::isLogged()` in `initialize()`. Those pages **MUST NEVER** render for anonymous users. `AIRULES/03`
- Comments: English. Public Controllers/Middleware PHPDoc **MUST** start with `CRCchecking —` (exact prefix/middleware XOR this action XOR none) then a purpose sentence; labeled **`// Why:`** / **`// About:`** / **`// Section:`** — never tags-only, never prefix CRC + `crcCheck()` in the same method, never narration of the code (`AIRULES/25` §7, `AIRULES/08`)
- DB: `DB::module("RAW")->q(fn($qb)=>...)->all()` + `[0] ?? null` (never bare `first()`). **MUST** `execute($ok,$err)` both callbacks. Persist `try/catch`. `AIRULES/18`
- Views: `{{ var: $x }}`, `{{ /if }}`, `{{ /foreach }}` — NOT `{{ $x }}` / `endif`. VIEW = outer file; `setLayout`+`renderView()` fills `{{ content }}` in that view (or `renderLayout()` / inject a string). **HTML via Renderer (LAW):** when it can be a template it **MUST** be; **MUST NOT** `$html .= '<table'` factories. PHP markup **only** for a named one-piece exception. `AIRULES/05` §1b + §1c
- Forms: `<fo-rm>` + `{{ formName(x) }}` **MUST between** `<fo-rm>` and `</fo-rm>` — **only** real multi-field submit + `/assets/dotapp/dotapp.js` + `crcCheck()` **once** (API prefix **or** action) + `form()`. Row actions (toggle/delete/reorder/D&D) = `$dotapp().load()` + encrypted `data-*` — NOT one `<fo-rm>` per button
- Request: `data()` = protected (`protect()`); `data(true)` = original — **MUST** `true` for passwords, HTML, hashes. Show every login failure. `AIRULES/19`
- Sample: `AIRULES/examples/EX-01-secure-form-complete.md`
- JS: `$dotapp` + `/assets/dotapp/dotapp.js` — NOT jQuery `$`
- 2FA code boxes: `$dotapp().twoFactor` — NOT a custom OTP widget (`AIRULES/09` §3, EX-14)
- Deletes: graphical confirm first — NOT `alert()` / `window.confirm()` (`AIRULES/09` §3)
- UI copy: product language — NOT prompt-echo / “this user can…” (`AIRULES/05` §8)
- Session: `DSM::use('Shop')` — NOT `$_SESSION` / `session_start()` (`AIRULES/20`)
- Persist: PHP re-checks — NOT a JS overlay/modal as the only gate (`AIRULES/08`)
- Privilege: no secret in read-only views; no escalate; SQL owner scope; own password needs current; **warn** if public noauth is bot-bait — CAPTCHA not MUST (`AIRULES/11` §11)
- Attacks (LAW, `AIRULES/24`): `{{ var: }}` does **NOT** escape → `htmlspecialchars` in PHP, `.text()` in JS; whitelist sort + writable columns (no `$request->data()` spread); no input in `header()` / `redirect` / `HttpHelper` URL; no `eval` / `exec` / `unserialize` / `include $x`; `random_bytes` tokens + `hash_equals` secrets; `throttle()` public POST; no `getMessage()` / `var_dump` in the reply; upload = ext + `finfo` + headers
- Files: `$dotapp().uploadFile` — NOT `FormData` + `load()` / `<fo-rm>`. PHP rejects `.php` (ext + `finfo` MIME + headers) (`AIRULES/09`)
- After `fo-rm` / `load` success while staying on the page: patch `reply.html` + toast — NOT `location.reload()`. **MUST** overlay the form/list with **module preloaders** until the request ends (desktop **and** mobile). (`AIRULES/09` §3, EX-06)
- Public website: overlay nav drawer L/R; lock page scroll while open; drawer list scrolls; contacts+compact search in the drawer unless large search is its own section (`AIRULES/09` §3)
- Accumulating lists (users, logs, items, …): **MUST** `paginate()` + **interactive AJAX** pager on first ship — NOT `->all()`, NOT `<a href="?page=">` / `location.reload()`, NOT “few rows now so skip”. Lookup lists: **MUST** AJAX search unless declined; **ASK** on other lists. (`AIRULES/06`, `AIRULES/09` §3, EX-06)
- Cheap I/O: `exists()` / `COUNT(*)` / needed columns / one `join` — NOT `all()` then filter, NOT N+1. `AIRULES/06`
- Memory (`AIRULES/25` §1): page big sets; keyed map + `isset()` instead of `in_array()` in a loop; `$out[] =` not `array_merge` per iteration; `unset` the raw copy; stream files — NOT load-all-then-filter
- Indexes (`AIRULES/25` §3): every FK + every `WHERE`/`JOIN`/`ORDER BY` column; composite = **equality → range → sort**; leftmost prefix counts; no index duplicating a composite prefix; one comment line per index naming its query; later index = new `Installation.php` version + `indexExists()`
- Columns (`AIRULES/25` §4): realistic `VARCHAR`, `decimal(10,2)` money, `NOT NULL` + default, FK `bigInteger()->unsigned()` (matches `id()` = BIGINT) — NOT `string()` 255 for a status, NOT `float` money
- Docs (`AIRULES/25` §7): Controllers/Middleware public PHPDoc **MUST** start with `CRCchecking —` (exact prefix/middleware XOR this action XOR none) then a purpose sentence, then `@param`/`@return`/`@throws` with meaning — NOT tags-only (`@return array<string, mixed>`); NOT prefix CRC + `crcCheck()` in the same method; inline **MUST** use `// Why:` (logical step), `// About:` (what the chunk is), `// Section:` (menu/route) — NOT narration (`// increment i`), NOT unlabeled Why prose, NOT prompt-echo, NOT dead code / bare `TODO`
- Cursor credits: **ASK** in the plan before expensive models. Subagents **inherit**. Composer 2.5 = file hunt only — NOT the programmer. (`AIRULES/00` §2b)
- Finish gate (LAW): after every chunk grep `crcCheck` once, enc IDs, bound SQL, `data(true)`, middleware vs action, `Events::trigger` vs `.hooks`, `// Why:` / `// About:` / `// Section:` — then claim done. (`AIRULES/00` §2c, `AIRULES/41`, `AIRULES/25` §7)
- Visible outcome (LAW): user always sees save/fail; public = mark the wrong field; build your own toast. (`AIRULES/00` §2d)
- Module hooks (LAW): useful side-effects MUST `Events::trigger('module.{mod}.{name}.hook')` + Hook/Why/About/Params/Use block + `app/modules/<M>/.hooks` — NOT every save; NOT secrets; NOT patch the other module; pre-action stop = `triggerWithVeto()` + `Veto` (`AIRULES/41`, EX-16)
- Extender (judge — not every method): owner `exists()` + `call()`; ordinary result returns, only `isOriginal()` continues; `extend()` in `Listeners::register()`; target listener routes; own Module routes or `[]`; controller string preferred — NOT `next()`, marker response, `.loaded` for initialize-time, global `['*']` just to attach, Events, `$request`/secrets, duplicate (`AIRULES/12` §10, EX-17)
- PHP 7.4+ (ASK in the plan): default floor; no `match` / `?->` / union `mixed` / named args / promotion / attributes / `enum` / `readonly` / `str_contains` unless they named a higher version (`AIRULES/00` §2i)
- Installer DDL: probe `SHOW TABLES LIKE` / `information_schema` then `CREATE`/`ALTER` — NOT `CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS` / `ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS` / `ADD INDEX IF NOT EXISTS` (`AIRULES/07` §0)

## Never ignore return values (AIRULES/18)

- `execute($ok, $err)` — **omitting `$err` throws**
- `first()` unsafe when empty (RAW warns, ORM fatal) → `all()` + `[0] ?? null`
- `Crypto::decrypt` → **`false`** · `Cache::load` → **`null`**
- `HttpHelper::request` / `FastSearch::*` → check `['success']`
- `Email::send` → **array of error strings**, not `false`
- `Auth::login` → **`false`** on malformed input
- missing view/layout → **`""`**, no exception
- `Validator::validate` → `true` or error array (compare `=== true`)
- wrap AI / SchemaBuilder / raw DDL in `try/catch`; never empty `catch {}`
- **Catch bus (LAW, `AIRULES/18` §9):** every `catch` **and** every `execute()` `$err` → one module report helper → `Events::trigger('dotapp.catch', $p)` then `dotapp.catch.error` (aborted) / `dotapp.catch.info` (recovered). Fixed payload: `severity, module, source, operation, message, exception, code, file, line, time` + `context` (ids/counts), `user_id` — NO passwords/tokens/2FA codes/request bodies. Reporting is **extra**, the user still sees the outcome
- `$qb->raw()`: every `?` is a placeholder (including comments / `COMMENT 'SMS?'`) — do not put `?` unless it is a real binding

